>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Manually reviewed Lewis representation. Ru–N–O 172.83°, N–O 1.16526 Å, g-xTB N–O WBO 1.8467. The closed-shell assignment for this near-linear terminal ligand is N≡[O+], with metal formal charge +2 and total charge +0. Terminal ligand identity, the remaining graph and charge balance were checked; The original M–N–O angle, M–N and N–O distances, and WBO agree with documented NO⁺ controls matched by metal, formal state, NO count and ligand class. Localized 12 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. A source representation differs from the reference. The atom order and coordinates of all 31 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 27 nonmetal covalent bonds: 26 within range, 0 outside range and 1 with sparse controls.

