>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Single-point calculation on the original coordinates and ligand-by-ligand Lewis review. The two oxalate carbons in the input are separated by 3.134 Å. All four C–O bonds of the two CO₂ groups have multiple-bond character, Retain intact diethylenetriamine and NH₃. Use the donor limit with two neutral CO₂ ligands and Co(I), Fragment polarization and calculated spin are recorded separately. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

